With this in mind, you are tasked to prove the following target statement.

Target Problem (your task):

\begin{theorem}
\label{thm:transversal}
    For the problem of finding a maximum-weight independent set in a transversal matroid $\MM$, \Cref{AlgoTransversalOn} is $8$-competitive in expectation, i.e., $ 8 \cdot \EXP{w(M)} \geq \EXP{\opt}$, where $\opt$ is the weight of a maximum-weight independent set in the transversal matroid $\MM.$
